    "detailed_description": "NOTTOLOT is a robot hacking action game.<br>Use the main character's ability to hack enemy robots to escape from the factory!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512830/extras/61c2259eeaaab47e0df1823c1576f26c.avif?t=1711439918\" /></span>\u3000<br><br><strong>\u25a0Exhilarating hacking action</strong><br>Control enemy robots with the main character's ability to hack them.<br>Sneak up from behind...tackle and hack!<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512830/extras/d5a5422fa7c30d2f1d806db119971443.poster.avif?t=1711439918\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512830/extras/d5a5422fa7c30d2f1d806db119971443.webm?t=1711439918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512830/extras/d5a5422fa7c30d2f1d806db119971443.mp4?t=1711439918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u25a0Enemy robots with various functions</strong><br>Fly in the sky, climb walls, and more,<br>Manipulate enemies to break through gimmicks and clear all three stages!<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512830/extras/bf1582ad0e4d92bd164adfff21eb6f04.poster.avif?t=1711439918\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512830/extras/bf1582ad0e4d92bd164adfff21eb6f04.webm?t=1711439918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512830/extras/bf1582ad0e4d92bd164adfff21eb6f04.mp4?t=1711439918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u25a0Tense factory escape</strong><br>The main character &quot;Rolly&quot; longs for the outside world.<br>Can he escape from the robot production factory guarded by enemy robots?<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512830/extras/974ea00cbf5a1ad679044d58412df7d3.poster.avif?t=1711439918\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512830/extras/974ea00cbf5a1ad679044d58412df7d3.webm?t=1711439918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2512830/extras/974ea00cbf5a1ad679044d58412df7d3.mp4?t=1711439918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
